WEBVTT

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.250
Oh, no! I made a mistake!

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.880
This is good... Very good.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.470
Do you smell something strange?

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:25.190
Okay...

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.450
The color changed.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:27.510
Mine, too.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:29.100
Are you finished?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.160
Here...

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.370
It's too strong! It smells more 
like air freshener than perfume.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.820
What are you saying?

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.400
What about yours?

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:41.520
What's this? It smells just like incense!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:46.160
Calm down... Perfume isn't as 
easy to make as we thought.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:47.390
I'm done!

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:50.080
Did you put it in a bottle?

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.850
I bought a spray bottle 
to use for the experiment.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.700
How chic!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:55.300
Here...

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:56.700
Let me see...

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:58.590
It's nice.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:00:59.630
It sure is.

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:02.190
Honoka's a genius, after all.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:08.900
Ready?

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.380
Another outrageous guy appeared again...

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:21.750
No matter how hard we tried, we 
were no match at all for him.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:26.200
What in the world are we supposed 
to do if that guy shows up again?

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:30.460
Getting rid of him this last 
time as more or less a miracle.

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:36.170
I wonder if it means that Pretty 
Cure's power is stronger than before.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.740
But since we've come this far,

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:43.840
I want to get all seven Prism 
Stones as soon as possible,

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:47.380
so we can revive Mipple and Mepple's 
Field of Light to what it was before.

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:53.990
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:56.790
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:59.630
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:03.900
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.870
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.740
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:11.640
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:15.550
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:17.150
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:22.950
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.060
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:28.830
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.830
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.400
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:38.570
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:41.440
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:47.710
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:48.610
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:51.320
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:54.120
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:57.020
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:58.590
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.660
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:09.250
The light is coming closer.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:15.290
The only way for us to attain 
eternal life is to annihilate it.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.670
Annihilating it is the only way!

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:22.060
Jyaku-King, sir...

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.610
Go!

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:29.400
Jyaku-King is getting very impatient!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.630
Don't worry... Have faith in me.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:34.470
You shouldn't take them lightly.

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:35.900
Don't take me for a fool!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.590
I'm going to do it for sure this time.

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:41.660
If we continue to neglect Jyaku-King's 
dark powers of annihilation,

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:47.400
not only our Dotsuku Zone, but 
Jyaku-King himself be annihilated.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:51.710
In other words, in order for Jyaku-King 
to be complete, we must use any means...

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.910
I know! If we can just get 
those two little creatures,

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:57.680
we'll know where the two stones 
that Pisard and Gekidrago lost,

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:01.620
and the two stones whose presence 
has disappeared, are hidden.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:05.920
That's right. However, their power 
has gotten even stronger now.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.600
It won't be that easy.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:12.980
I'll bring those Prism Stones back even 
if I have to give my life in exchange!

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:21.310
"WHICH IS THE REAL ONE? 
THERE ARE TWO HONOKAS"

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.590
Nagisa!

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.040
Honoka!

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:26.010
Are you done?

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:27.580
Let's go home together.

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.840
What is it?

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.750
I smell something nice.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.930
I'm making perfume as an experiment.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.020
It smells like Europe.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.880
Europe? Have you ever been there?

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.790
I didn't know... Where?

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.650
Frankfurt...

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.390
Germany? When did you go?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.800
And French bread.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:52.930
Huh?

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.570
Belgium waffles.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.430
Aren't those all things you eat?

00:04:56.690 --> 00:05:00.010
You should know that I've 
never been to Europe!

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:03.390
Shall we stop by for some of Akane-san's 
"takoyaki" (octopus dumplings)?

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:04.250
I don't want to.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:06.740
Just kidding!

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:08.690
Thank goodness.

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.320
I'll meet you at the school gate.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:13.230
I'll change right away.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.480
I'll be waiting!

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:25.770
That's strange...

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.810
What happened to Honoka?

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.340
I'm hungry mepo!

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:29.730
Hey!

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:33.100
Not now! We're still at school!

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.350
I'm hungry! I'm hungry! I'm hungry mepo!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.060
I said not now!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.470
I can't wait any longer!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.950
Don't you have any capacity to learn?

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:44.970
You just had a fight with Mipple the other 
day because you kept saying the same thing.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:50.070
I can fight with Mipple any time because she 
and I have complete trust in each other mepo.

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:54.520
So you think she trusts you, do you?

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.980
What do you mean by that mepo?

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:57.220
Nothing...

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:59.700
What about you mepo?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:04.260
I don't mean to brag, but...

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.340
I'm open-hearted, I'm good 
at looking after people,

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.420
I'm also good at lacrosse, so I'm...

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:12.380
He... he... he... mepo!

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:13.640
What do you mean by that?

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.340
Maybe you're the only one 
who thinks that mepo!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.700
What's that?

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.190
You're so adorable mepo!

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.570
You're more dazzling today than 
I've ever seen you before mepo!

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.560
Shall we leave it at that mepo?

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.350
Bye bye!

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.280
But I said I was hungry...

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.840
It's all your fault!

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:38.620
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.310
One of the senior members of the science 
club came up to me after you left.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:42.940
Is that what happened?

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.740
He's asleep right now. Let's go.

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:54.280
Hello...

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.940
Kiriya-kun...

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.680
Are you wearing perfume?

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:02.440
Yes, I am.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:05.510
We all made it as an experiment 
for the science club.

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:08.580
By any chance, did you mix in the 
essence of lily of the valley?

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:10.610
I'm surprised you knew!

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:15.420
I used rose as a base, but using 
a hint of lily of the valley

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:16.940
was the main point of this experiment.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.980
So it's just as I thought.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:20.130
You're very good.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:23.380
None of the other members 
of the science club noticed.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.410
But you don't have to use perfume...

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.230
What is it?

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:34.560
Nothing.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.580
Here you go!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.100
I added an extra one for each of you.

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.770
Thank you very much.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:49.020
Just what I'd expect from you, Akane-san.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:50.750
Let's eat!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.840
Aren't you going to eat it?

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:59.400
I smelled so much perfume today 
that my mind is in a daze.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.870
Are you okay? Maybe you should go home...

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.880
No... I'm fine.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.380
It'll go away in no time,

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.650
so don't worry about it.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:10.230
Are you sure? Let me know 
if you don't feel well.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:15.930
Come to think of it. What's Mipple doing?

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:18.370
Mipple!

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:23.840
Mipple... What happened to that anyway?

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:26.200
How could you refer to Mipple as "that"?

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:29.160
Did you fight with Mipple, too?

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:31.850
That's right. I did.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:37.250
I had a fight, too. He was really rude to me.

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.220
He's fast asleep.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.480
Let me see that.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.250
But he's sleeping.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:49.830
Actually, he was bothering me 
so much that I put him to sleep.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:54.490
Nagisa! When is your next 
lacrosse practice match?

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:57.820
It's next Saturday.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:02.110
I'll see what I can do, 
so I can come to watch.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.920
I'm sure everyone will be happy.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.420
Be sure to come.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:07.910
Let me warn you...

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:11.890
If I come to watch, I won't 
forgive you if you lose!

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:13.130
Of course we'll win!

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.420
Excuse me!

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:19.000
Won't you come, too?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.970
If I can...

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:24.170
Never mind... Let me see Mipple.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.470
Mipple?

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:27.440
That...

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.890
Hurry, and let me see Mipple.

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.440
This can't be!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.400
Aren't you going to show it to me?

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.060
Who are you?

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.990
What are you saying?

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:46.290
Honoka would never call Mepple Mipple.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.760
I see... Is that what it is?

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:08.220
She already left?

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.980
Not too long ago.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.520
I didn't even realize she left.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:15.610
Didn't you leave with her, Honoka?

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:17.640
She left with me?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.650
What is it?

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:21.640
Excuse me!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.000
Wait, Honoka!

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:27.400
Another one of me...? What's going on?

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:28.940
Nagisa!

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:42.570
I never expected to come 
in the form of Honoka.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:43.560
It's not possi...

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:44.480
Nagisa!

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:46.660
I've been looking for you...

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.150
Nagisa!

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:50.330
Excuse me...

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:53.140
Give me a break!

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:54.260
Nagisa?

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:58.110
Nagisa!

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:02.980
Two Honokas? Which one is the real one?

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:04.050
I'm the real one.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:05.470
See?

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:09.940
It's the perfume I smelled earlier.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.350
You recognize it, don't you?

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.060
You're lying!

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.810
That doesn't prove that she's the real one.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:17.890
She snuck into the clubroom, and put it on.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:22.900
I can prove it. I'm the 
one who has the perfume.

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.730
Don't let her fool you.

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:31.040
You snuck into the clubroom, didn't you?

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.410
What are you saying? I have the proof.

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.500
Which one is it?

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:40.610
This can't be happening!

00:11:57.810 --> 00:12:00.060
I'm the real one, Nagisa.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:01.300
Nagisa!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:03.680
That's right!

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:04.710
What?

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.850
What's Mipple doing now?

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:08.070
She's sleeping.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:08.980
Mipple's right here.

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.470
Now you know, don't you? I'm the real one.

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.090
No... I'm the real one...

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.950
Then what's the name of our homeroom teacher?

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.850
It's Ms. Yoshimi, of course!

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:24.920
Then... when is my birthday?

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.600
It's October 10th.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.890
Your astrological sign is Libra, 
and your blood type is O.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.520
Anybody can find that out.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.450
Nagisa!

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:35.000
Yes?

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.290
Look me in the eye!

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.320
Nagisa!

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:40.560
What's my favorite food?

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:41.500
"Takoyaki."

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:44.040
That's right.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:46.010
It's chocolate, isn't it?

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:48.010
I love chocolate!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.140
Don't you like "takoyaki"?

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.290
Of course I do!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.280
Maybe I made a mistake with that question.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:56.030
You love sports, Nagisa.

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:57.780
You're right!

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:00.550
But you don't like to study.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.620
I guess.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.720
You don't like round onions.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:04.710
You're right.

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:06.190
You're the type who loses 
sight of everything around you

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:08.020
when you're concentrating on something.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:11.060
I guess that's right, too.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.920
You're the type who can't say "no" 
when someone asks you to do something.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.040
You may be right about that, too.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.350
You're scatterbrained.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.210
It's true that I'm scatterbrained,

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:21.550
but you don't have to come 
right out and say it.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:24.850
Your socks are a little smelly.

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:27.940
What are you saying?

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:29.910
Why would my socks be...?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.890
I like to be active...

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:36.600
Studying is boring.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:39.080
I love the smell of grass.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:42.730
My socks are a little smelly.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:45.910
Honoka!

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:47.250
Nagisa!

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.420
I guess it can't be helped then.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.470
Let's go inside here for now.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.360
Okay.

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:15.950
Are you prepared?

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:20.370
I'm really serious today!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.460
What...? What is it mipo?

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:30.460
I have a really bad feeling about this...

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:32.680
It's not just a feeling! It's already here!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.560
I hope you're prepared!

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.580
Nagisa!

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:52.500
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:10.190
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.920
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:16.590
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.400
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:23.630
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:32.310
I'm sorry, but I can't go home today.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.910
I'm not going to hold back!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.600
I'm going to give it to you!

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:48.920
It's nice being young, isn't it?

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.460
I envy you.

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.830
Running at full force on just power alone.

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:56.850
How dare you turn yourself 
into Honoka to approach me!

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:57.820
